 "description":
 "Chapter 12's Entity List. A server's names and rates are child specifications, each the latest of a mutable property. The filtered and restoring feeds of the server go on to them; the excluding feed does not, so the name of a terminated server is deferred until it is rehired. The sibling child specifications both declare next, which only one feed at a time binds."}
